<title>SRI LANKA: S.Lanka tourist arrivals up 21 pct Jan-May-paper.</title>
<headline>S.Lanka tourist arrivals up 21 pct Jan-May-paper.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty-one percent more tourists visited Sri Lanka in the first five months of this year than in the corresponding period in 1996, the government-run Daily News on Wednesday quoted a Central Bank official as saying.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>Central Bank officials were not immediately available for comment on the report.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
